### Verify a payment by transactionId (poll; also activates the participant on success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "REPLACE_WITH_32CHAR_TRANSACTION_ID"
}

### Mojo collection callback (public, guarded by trustId path param)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/callback/win-pc-2f8a1b4e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "REPLACE_WITH_32CHAR_TRANSACTION_ID"
}

### List payments (admin) — filter by method and/or status
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List payments filtered by method (card | momo | cash)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?method=momo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List payments filtered by status (pending | completed | failed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?status=completed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List payments filtered by method + status
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?method=momo&status=failed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
